                                "sense_id": "f9bcaa56-0f00-30ee-82c7-62aa4a94ab22",
                                "text": "Romansch (Ger. Churwalsch, from the town of Chur), a name applied to the Romance dialect, or rather agglomeration of cognate dialects, spoken from the Grisons to Friuli on the Adriatic. ]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
